# Environment variables read by the bundled MCP server.
# Copy to .env and fill in the keys for the models you plan to use.
# The .env file is gitignored.

# --- Anthropic (Claude) ---
# Required by every policy. The subagent driving the run is Opus.
# If you use a Claude Code subscription (Pro / Team / Enterprise), Claude
# Code handles auth for you — leave this unset. See docs/setup.md.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Google (Gemini) ---
# Required only by the opus-plus-flash policy (mechanical phases dispatch
# to Gemini 3.5 Flash). Not needed by opus-only.
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
